keywords:
  - Plexcal
  - FRET
  - Dexter energy transfer
  - protein structure
  - kinetic Monte Carlo
  - energy migration
abstract: >-
  Plexcal is a structure-aware scientific software tool for estimating photo excitation
  energy-transfer diffusion lengths from protein structures using implemented
  FRET- and Dexter-related models.
